# Local migration packages. An encrypted owner migration export is the most
# credential-dense file this system handles and routinely runs to hundreds of
# megabytes, so it stays on the operator's machine and out of git. Ignoring it
# also keeps the em dash gate honest: that check intent-to-adds untracked files
# before diffing, and a 124 MB package overflows the diff buffer and fails the
# gate for reasons that have nothing to do with the change under test.
docs/resources/
